    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overage \u2013 Child of Chaos is a fast-paced roguelike and horde-style shooter<br>developed by CopyCat Game Studios. It is a game that delivers an intense and rewarding power trip, where players confront challenging enemies while embracing the chaos. The game cleverly satirizes familiar media tropes, letting players battle through exaggerated clich\u00e9s with a mix of skill and strategy. Although the combat requires precision and quick thinking, each victory makes players feel like an unstoppable force, with the thrill of overcoming tough obstacles. The chaotic energy, combined with witty humor, creates an epic, <br>adrenaline-pumping experience that\u2019s both challenging and empowering.</p>",
